# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DEFAULT DENY.
#
# Everything in this repository is ignored unless it is explicitly allowed
# below. This is deliberate: sources/ contains the professor's unpublished
# draft and the diploma thesis, and git history is permanent. A blocklist
# fails open (forget one pattern and it leaks); an allowlist fails closed.
#
# To publish a new file or folder, add an explicit "!" line for it.
# If a new file does not show up in `git status`, that is this rule working.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Ignore everything at the repository root
/*

# --- Explicitly published -------------------------------------------------
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!docs/

# --- Never published, listed again for clarity ----------------------------
# sources/    professor's draft + thesis — not ours to publish
# _memory/    raw working notes
# research/   internal research notes
# CLAUDE.md   internal working rules
# MAP.md      personal cheat sheet

# --- Standard exclusions (apply inside allowed folders too) ---------------
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
